      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "Long story short. Yeah, long story short. The other day, I received a question from my colleague in one of the internal chats. She has an Israeli client who's asking, Hey, I'm a bit scared of investing in Dubai because what if they take away my ownership rights? What do you think about the conflict between Qatar and UAE in 2017? I read the question. I'm like, what conflict between Qatar and UAE? So I went researching, found out that there was one. And it actually lasted till 2021. And even the citizens of Qatar were asked to leave the country of UAE during this time. But even during this time, there weren't any massive cases of taking away the property of those people. So this gives us an idea of the position. The strategic thinking of supreme leaders of our country. They're always thinking about the future. They have a plan 10, 20 years up ahead.",
